<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2030808647"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1676001484"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="私は、私達は"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Guiano / 可不"/><amll:meta key="album" value="私は、私達は"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:56.588"><div begin="00:01.447" end="03:10.254"><p begin="00:01.447" end="00:02.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">あぁ 何もない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊 越是害怕一无所有的自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">kyo ku ： Guiano</span></p><p begin="00:03.398" end="00:05.486" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">自分が怖くなるほど</p><p begin="00:06.277" end="00:08.528" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">完璧さってやつに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">越是会把追求完美</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka n pe ki sa 't te ya tsu ni</span></p><p begin="00:09.012" end="00:11.317" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">すぐ縋ってしまうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当做救命稻草</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gu su ga 't te shi ma u yo</span></p><p begin="00:12.008" end="00:14.741" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">涙は もう二度と見せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再在别人面前落泪了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi da ha mo u ni do to mi se na i</span></p><p begin="00:15.259" end="00:16.896" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">もう見せないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也不会了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u mi se na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:17.498" end="00:19.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">心はどうだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么今天这颗心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ha do u da ro u</span></p><p begin="00:19.569" end="00:22.509" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">昨日より乾いたかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是否有比昨天少一些泪水呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki no u yo ri ka wa i ta ka na</span></p><p begin="00:23.363" end="00:27.031" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">心は言う 涙は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这颗心告诉我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ha i u</span></p><p begin="00:28.943" end="00:30.908" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">あなただけのものだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只属于你一人啊</span></p><p begin="00:31.666" end="00:32.327" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算因为你说的话而感到受伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra a na ta no ko to ba ni ki zu tsu i te mo</span></p><p begin="00:36.691" end="00:40.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">あなたの言葉に傷ついても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使被你的话语所伤</span></p><p begin="00:41.819" end="00:44.508" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">私は私だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也依然是我 我不会再迷茫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha wa ta shi da ka ra ma yo u ko to ha na i</span></p><p begin="00:44.960" end="00:46.547" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">迷うことはない</p><p begin="00:47.249" end="00:50.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">守られることはもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然肯定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ra re ru ko to ha</span></p><p begin="00:50.625" end="00:52.210" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">きっとないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会再有人守护我了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ki 't to na i ke do</span></p><p begin="00:52.963" end="00:55.368" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">守りたいものばかりさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我拥有了许多想要守护的东西 所以不用担心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ri ta i mo no ba ka ri sa shi n pa i ha na i</span></p><p begin="00:56.090" end="00:57.756" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">心配はない</p><p begin="00:59.226" end="01:00.629" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">怖いものはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么好害怕的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa i mo no ha na i</span></p><p begin="01:01.848" end="01:03.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">恐れはしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都不足为惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o so re ha shi na i</span></p><p begin="01:04.769" end="01:06.258" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">怖いものはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么好害怕的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa i mo no ha na i</span></p><p begin="01:07.526" end="01:09.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">恐れはしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都不足为惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o so re ha shi na i</span></p><p begin="01:38.994" end="01:41.199" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">人は欲しがる存在証明とか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">人总是急于追求一些不必要的东西</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi to ha ho shi ga ru so n za i sho u me i to ka</span></p><p begin="01:41.800" end="01:43.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">特別、個性とか必要ないの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么存在意义 什么特别抑或个性</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to ku be tsu ko se i to ka hi tsu yo u na i no</span></p><p begin="01:44.573" end="01:46.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">私の苦悩その答えを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而我不过只是想要将我的苦恼</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi no ku no u so no ko ta e wo</span></p><p begin="01:47.379" end="01:48.699" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">歌ってやるだけさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将你的答案 唱成歌给你听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ta 't te ya ru da ke sa</span></p><p begin="01:49.273" end="01:52.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">涙はもう二度と見せない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会再在别人面前落泪了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi da ha mo u ni do to mi se na i</span></p><p begin="01:52.763" end="01:54.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">もう見せないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再也不会了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u mi se na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:54.940" end="01:56.777" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">明日はどうだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那么明天的我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a shi ta ha do u da ro u</span></p><p begin="01:56.908" end="02:00.091" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">昨日より笑えたかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">会比昨天绽放多一些的笑容吗</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki no u yo ri wa ra e ta ka na</span></p><p begin="02:00.763" end="02:04.417" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">心は言う 明日は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这颗心告诉我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko ko ro ha i u</span></p><p begin="02:06.294" end="02:08.359" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">あなただけのものだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只属于你一人啊</span></p><p begin="02:09.070" end="02:09.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算因为你的话语而感到受伤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da ka ra a na ta no ko to ba ni ki zu tsu i te mo</span></p><p begin="02:13.975" end="02:18.118" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">あなたの言葉に傷ついても<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使被你的话语所伤</span></p><p begin="02:19.137" end="02:21.676" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">私は私だから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也依然是我 我不会再迷茫</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ha wa ta shi da ka ra ma yo u ko to ha na i</span></p><p begin="02:22.313" end="02:23.897" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">迷うことはない</p><p begin="02:24.913" end="02:27.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">守られることはもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然肯定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ra re ru ko to ha</span></p><p begin="02:27.965" end="02:29.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">きっとないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会再有人守护我了</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo u ki 't to na i ke do</span></p><p begin="02:30.405" end="02:32.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">守りたいものばかりさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我拥有了许多想要守护的东西 所以不用担心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma mo ri ta i mo no ba ka ri sa shi n pa i ha na i</span></p><p begin="02:33.542" end="02:35.345" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">心配はない</p><p begin="02:36.437" end="02:38.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">怖いものはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么好害怕的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa i mo no ha na i</span></p><p begin="02:39.285" end="02:40.843" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">恐れはしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都不足为惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o so re ha shi na i</span></p><p begin="02:42.141" end="02:43.663" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">怖いものはない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没什么好害怕的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko wa i mo no ha na i</span></p><p begin="02:44.880" end="02:46.531" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">恐れはしない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都不足为惧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o so re ha shi na i</span></p><p begin="03:09.736" end="03:10.254" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">せーの！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">预备</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">se e no</span></p></div></body></tt>